\",\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\",\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\"],\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":[],\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":[]},\"contents\":{\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\":{\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【再见。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e嗯，祝您一路顺风。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"},\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":{\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【开场白】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e哦？客官，稀客稀客。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"},\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":{\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【怎么就是稀客了？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e毕竟这附近就没几个客人嘛，荒郊野岭的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e您倒是不怕我们这儿是黑店…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e哈哈哈…玩笑玩笑，可别跟我老板说我又吓唬客人了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"},\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":{\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【说说你自己？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e我嘛…曾经的我名声倒是不怎么好，喜欢混迹街头，打打闹闹。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e后来盯上这位朱老板，一看就是个财主，所以来这边领领工钱混日子。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e不过这日子居然比我想象的还要清闲，久而久之，忽然觉得没有之前那种心劲儿了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e现在，我只想找个姑娘安定下来…也不知道是年岁大了，还是这平淡的日子把我给改变了…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"}}}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"3885","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1746594984","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"69","tab_name":"页签1","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"691","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"1207","pos":"left"},{"id":"1208","pos":"right"},{"id":"3882","pos":"banner"}],"name":"基本资料","repeated":false,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"692","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":